2634:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c **** /**
2635:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the TIM One Pulse Time Base according to the specified
2636:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         parameters in the TIM_HandleTypeDef and initializes the associated handle.
2637:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
2638:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
2639:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
2640:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: call @ref HAL_TIM_OnePulse_DeInit() before HAL_TIM_OnePulse_Init()
2641:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   When the timer instance is initialized in One Pulse mode, timer
2642:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
2643:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         purpose.
2644:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  htim TIM One Pulse handle
